WEBVTT

00:00:06.897 --> 00:00:08.769
[thuds]

00:00:17.517 --> 00:00:20.868
[thunder rumbling]

00:00:41.279 --> 00:00:44.065
[gasps] Ohh!

00:00:44.239 --> 00:00:46.458
Yeah, like you could
make me drink that.

00:00:46.633 --> 00:00:48.417
Aaahh! Aaah...

00:00:49.461 --> 00:00:50.767
[groans]

00:00:50.941 --> 00:00:52.813
If I wanted you dead,

00:00:52.987 --> 00:00:55.206
I would have left you
in that river.

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:56.643
Well, why save me?

00:00:56.817 --> 00:00:59.341
So you can fulfill
your destiny.

00:00:59.515 --> 00:01:02.692
What are you talking about?
Where am I?

00:01:04.999 --> 00:01:07.088
[Po] What is this place?

00:01:07.262 --> 00:01:10.787
I'm surprised you
remember so little.

00:01:10.961 --> 00:01:14.312
But you were so little
when it happened.

00:01:14.486 --> 00:01:16.750
- [muffled uproar]
- Aah!

00:01:19.622 --> 00:01:22.103
Perhaps you do remember.

00:01:22.277 --> 00:01:24.366
What? It's just
a stupid nightmare.

00:01:24.540 --> 00:01:26.586
Nightmare or memory?

00:01:32.243 --> 00:01:33.636
[gurgling]

00:01:51.872 --> 00:01:53.308
[laughter]

00:01:57.617 --> 00:02:00.184
This was a thriving village.

00:02:00.358 --> 00:02:03.884
Young Shen was in line
to rule Gongmen City.

00:02:04.058 --> 00:02:05.929
But he wanted more.

00:02:06.103 --> 00:02:10.281
I foretold that someone
would stand in his way.

00:02:10.455 --> 00:02:12.066
A panda.

00:02:12.240 --> 00:02:15.852
But I never could have
foretold what came next.

00:02:16.026 --> 00:02:17.898
[baby crying]

00:02:19.682 --> 00:02:21.205
[cries out]

00:02:25.035 --> 00:02:26.950
[whimpers]

00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:30.519
Get them all!

00:02:37.352 --> 00:02:39.354
Take our son and run away.

00:02:39.528 --> 00:02:40.572
Go!

00:02:49.886 --> 00:02:50.974
[crying]

00:02:51.148 --> 00:02:53.455
[gasps]

00:02:54.238 --> 00:02:56.240
Stop fighting.

00:02:56.414 --> 00:02:57.720
Let it flow.

00:03:42.939 --> 00:03:44.158
[gasping]

00:03:48.205 --> 00:03:49.380
[snarling]

00:03:57.649 --> 00:03:59.695
[gurgles and mews]

00:04:02.089 --> 00:04:04.047
[crying]

00:04:05.309 --> 00:04:07.659
Shh. Shh!

00:04:10.445 --> 00:04:11.968
Mmm-ma.

00:04:16.799 --> 00:04:18.453
[gurgling]

00:04:22.979 --> 00:04:24.764
[crying]

00:04:31.335 --> 00:04:33.381
[snarling]

00:04:34.469 --> 00:04:36.819
[wailing]

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:45.349
[sighs heavily]

00:05:01.713 --> 00:05:05.848
Your story may not have
such a happy beginning

00:05:06.022 --> 00:05:09.069
but that doesn't
make you who you are.

00:05:09.243 --> 00:05:11.767
It is the rest of your story.

00:05:12.681 --> 00:05:14.814
Who you choose to be.

00:05:46.976 --> 00:05:50.327
So, who are you, panda?

00:05:58.553 --> 00:05:59.989
I am Po.

00:06:01.817 --> 00:06:03.732
And I'm gonna need a hat.

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:13.259
Such sad, sad faces.

